⍝ trith/lib/http.c: servers (plain and TLS) and their client in one program, split by fork.
⍝ The test runner makes the certificate and has the client trust it (SSL_CERT_FILE)
⎔ $fork$ ⟨⊸ ℤ⟩ ‹fork› ⸫
⎔ $trith_http_listen$ ⟨ℤ ⊸ ◌ℤ⟩ ‹listen› ⸫
⎔ $trith_http_listen_tls$ ⟨ℤ ʃ ʃ ⊸ ◌ℤ⟩ ‹listentls› ⸫
⎔ $trith_http_accept$ ⟨ℤ ⊸ ◌ℤ⟩ ‹accept› ⸫
⎔ $trith_http_req_path$ ⟨ℤ ⊸ ⸮◌ʃ⟩ ‹rqpath› ⸫
⎔ $trith_http_req_body$ ⟨ℤ ⊸ ⸮◌ʃ⟩ ‹rqbody› ⸫
⎔ $trith_http_req_header$ ⟨ℤ ʃ ⊸ ⸮◌ʃ⟩ ‹rqheader› ⸫
⎔ $trith_http_respond$ ⟨ℤ ℤ ⸮ʃ ⸮ʃ ⊸ ◌ℤ⟩ ‹respond› ⸫
⎔ $trith_http_close$ ⟨ℤ ⊸ ℤ⟩ ‹hclose› ⸫
⎔ $trith_http_get$ ⟨ʃ ⊸ ⸮◌ʃ⟩ ‹get› ⸫
⎔ $trith_http_request$ ⟨ʃ ʃ ʃ ʃ ⊸ ⸮◌ℤ⟩ ‹request› ⸫
⎔ $trith_http_response_body$ ⟨⊸ ⸮ʃ⟩ ‹rbody› ⸫
⎔ $trith_http_response_header$ ⟨ʃ ⊸ ⸮◌ʃ⟩ ‹rheader› ⸫
⎔ $trith_http_error$ ⟨⊸ ʃ⟩ ‹herror› ⸫

⍝ ‹or› s: the text, or ? if there is none (what came over the network is hearsay, ⸮)
⦃ ⁇ ⦃ ⦄ ⦃ $?$ ⦄ ⦄ ⟨⸮◌ʃ ⊸ ⸮ʃ⟩ ‹or› ⸫

⍝ ‹srvpath› server: answer the next request with its path
⦃
  ‹accept› ⁇
    ⦃ ⧖:h ⧗:h #200# $text/plain$ ⧗:h ‹rqpath› ‹or› ‹respond› ⁇ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ ⦄ ⦄
    ⦃ ⦄
⦄ ⟨ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹srvpath› ⸫

⍝ ‹srvecho› server: answer the next request with its body, typed as its X-Trith header says
⦃
  ‹accept› ⁇
    ⦃ ⧖:h ⧗:h #201# ⧗:h $X-Trith$ ‹rqheader› ‹or› ⧗:h ‹rqbody› ‹or› ‹respond› ⁇ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ ⦄ ⦄
    ⦃ ⦄
⦄ ⟨ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹srvecho› ⸫

⍝ ‹child› server tls: serve the two requests the parent makes of each, then stop
⦃
  ⧖:s,t
  ⧗:s ‹srvpath› ⧗:s ‹srvecho› ⧗:s ‹hclose› ⌁
  ⧗:t ‹srvpath› ⧗:t ‹srvecho› ⧗:t ‹hclose› ⌁
⦄ ⟨ℤ ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹child› ⸫

⍝ ‹parent› server tls: the client side, the only one that prints
⦃
  ‹hclose› ⌁ ‹hclose› ⌁
  $http://127.0.0.1:8471/hello$ ‹get› ⁇ ⦃ ⎙̵ ⦄ ⦃ $GET failed: $ ⎙̵ ‹herror› ⎙̵ ⦄ $\n$ ⎙̵
  $POST$ $http://127.0.0.1:8471/echo$ $X-Trith: text/x-trith$ $ping$ ‹request›
    ⁇ ⦃ ⎙ ⦄ ⦃ $POST failed: $ ⎙̵ ‹herror› ⎙̵ $\n$ ⎙̵ ⦄
  ‹rbody› ⎙̵ $\n$ ⎙̵
  $content-type$ ‹rheader› ‹or› ⎙̵ $\n$ ⎙̵
  ⍝ the certificate is for localhost and 127.0.0.1, so 127.0.0.2 (also this machine) is refused
  $https://127.0.0.2:8476/$ ‹get› ⁇ ⦃ ⎙̵ ⦄ ⦃ ‹herror› ⎙̵ ⦄ $\n$ ⎙̵
  $https://localhost:8476/secure$ ‹get› ⁇ ⦃ ⎙̵ ⦄ ⦃ $GET failed: $ ⎙̵ ‹herror› ⎙̵ ⦄ $\n$ ⎙̵
  $POST$ $https://127.0.0.1:8476/echo$ $X-Trith: text/x-tls$ $pong$ ‹request›
    ⁇ ⦃ ⎙ ⦄ ⦃ $POST failed: $ ⎙̵ ‹herror› ⎙̵ $\n$ ⎙̵ ⦄
  ‹rbody› ⎙̵ $\n$ ⎙̵
  $http://127.0.0.1:1/$ ‹get› ⁇ ⦃ ⎙̵ ⦄ ⦃ ‹herror› ⎙̵ ⦄ $\n$ ⎙̵
⦄ ⟨ℤ ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹parent› ⸫

⍝ ‹both› server tls: fork into the servers and the client
⦃
  ⧖:s,t
  ⧗:s,t ‹fork› ○ ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ‹child› ⦄ ⦃ ‹parent› ⦄ ⦃ ‹hclose› ⌁ ‹hclose› ⌁ $fork failed\n$ ⎙̵ ⦄
⦄ ⟨ℤ ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹both› ⸫

⍝ ‹start› server: open the TLS server too
⦃
  ⧖:s
  ⧗:s #8476# $output/lib-test/cert.pem$ $output/lib-test/key.pem$ ‹listentls›
    ⁇ ⦃ ‹both› ⦄ ⦃ $cannot listen: $ ⎙̵ ‹herror› ⎙̵ $\n$ ⎙̵ ‹hclose› ⌁ ⦄
⦄ ⟨ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹start› ⸫

⦃
  #8471# ‹listen› ⁇
    ⦃ ‹start› ⦄
    ⦃ $cannot listen: $ ⎙̵ ‹herror› ⎙̵ $\n$ ⎙̵ ⦄
⦄ ⟨⊸⟩ ᛟ ⸫
